WEBVTT

00:00:18.176 --> 00:00:19.336
Hey, Zone.

00:00:20.456 --> 00:00:22.176
(CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:25.576 --> 00:00:27.376
Huh? No!

00:00:27.696 --> 00:00:31.616
Did you see that?
That's the way to do it.

00:00:31.696 --> 00:00:33.016
That's old school.

00:00:33.176 --> 00:00:35.896
Yeah. No school
like the old school.

00:00:38.856 --> 00:00:40.376
Just like old times.

00:00:40.456 --> 00:00:41.656
Just like old times.
Oh!

00:00:41.736 --> 00:00:44.056
Yeah. Hurt then, too.

00:00:47.496 --> 00:00:49.816
We've frozen all of
Syndrome's assets.

00:00:49.896 --> 00:00:51.056
If he even sneezes,

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:53.896
we'll be there with
a hanky and a pair
of handcuffs.

00:00:53.976 --> 00:00:55.976
The people of this country
are indebted to you.

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:57.736
Does this mean we can
come out of hiding?

00:00:57.816 --> 00:00:59.816
Let the politicians
figure that one out.

00:00:59.896 --> 00:01:03.536
I've been asked to
assure you we'll take care
of everything else.

00:01:03.616 --> 00:01:04.656
You did good, Bob.

00:01:04.736 --> 00:01:05.776
(PHONE BEEPS)

00:01:06.056 --> 00:01:10.176
Hi, this is Kari.
I have a question
about Jack-Jack...

00:01:10.256 --> 00:01:11.696
Come on.
We're in a limo.

00:01:12.216 --> 00:01:14.736
Hey, you're wearing
your hair back?

00:01:14.816 --> 00:01:16.536
(STAMMERING)
Yeah, I just... Yeah.

00:01:16.616 --> 00:01:17.656
It looks good.

00:01:17.736 --> 00:01:18.736
Thanks, Dad.

00:01:18.816 --> 00:01:20.336
That was cool when
you threw that car!

00:01:20.416 --> 00:01:22.776
Not as cool as you
running on water.

00:01:22.856 --> 00:01:26.616
That was sweet
when you snagged that
bad guy with your arm

00:01:26.696 --> 00:01:29.336
and whiplashed him
into the other guy.
Sweet!

00:01:29.416 --> 00:01:30.976
I'm trying to
listen to messages.

00:01:31.056 --> 00:01:32.056
KARI: It's me.

00:01:32.256 --> 00:01:35.416
Jack-Jack is fine,
but weird things
are happening.

00:01:35.496 --> 00:01:39.096
Jack-Jack's still fine,
but I'm getting really
weirded out!

00:01:39.856 --> 00:01:41.176
When are you
coming back?

00:01:41.256 --> 00:01:43.696
...aced those guys
that tried to kill us!

00:01:43.776 --> 00:01:46.376
That was the best
vacation ever!

00:01:46.456 --> 00:01:47.896
I love our family.

00:01:47.976 --> 00:01:50.616
KARI: I'm not fine,
Mrs. Parr!

00:01:50.696 --> 00:01:53.576
Put that down! Stop it!
You need to call me.

00:01:53.656 --> 00:01:55.696
I need help, Mrs...

00:01:55.776 --> 00:01:57.376
Bob, listen to this.

00:01:57.456 --> 00:01:59.456
KARI: I'm gonna
call the police...

00:01:59.896 --> 00:02:01.616
Hi, this is Kari.

00:02:01.696 --> 00:02:05.696
Sorry for freaking out,
but your baby has
special needs.

00:02:06.456 --> 00:02:08.056
Thanks for sending
a replacement.

00:02:08.136 --> 00:02:10.296
I didn't call
a replacement.

00:02:15.056 --> 00:02:18.136
Shh. The baby is sleeping.

00:02:21.256 --> 00:02:23.056
You took away
my future.

00:02:23.136 --> 00:02:24.816
I'm simply returning
the favor.

00:02:24.896 --> 00:02:26.576
Don't worry,
I'll be a good mentor.

00:02:26.656 --> 00:02:29.816
Supportive, encouraging.
Everything you weren't.

00:02:30.136 --> 00:02:33.616
And in time, who knows,
he might make a good
sidekick.

00:02:38.136 --> 00:02:41.416
He's getting away, Bob!
We have to do something now.

00:02:41.656 --> 00:02:43.496
(JACK-JACK CRIES)

00:02:56.856 --> 00:02:58.336
What's happening?

00:03:04.176 --> 00:03:06.016
Stop him!
Throw something!

00:03:06.096 --> 00:03:07.376
I might hit Jack-Jack.

00:03:11.536 --> 00:03:13.016
Throw me.

00:03:17.376 --> 00:03:18.856
Bob, throw me!

00:03:23.216 --> 00:03:24.296
(JACK-JACK COOING)

00:03:25.056 --> 00:03:26.136
No!

00:03:28.456 --> 00:03:29.656
This isn't
the end of it!

00:03:29.736 --> 00:03:31.616
I will get your son,
eventually.

00:03:31.736 --> 00:03:33.136
I'll get your son!

00:03:35.216 --> 00:03:36.376
Oh, no.

00:03:47.936 --> 00:03:50.856
Look at Mommy, honey.
Don't look down.
Mommy's got you.

00:03:51.816 --> 00:03:53.696
Everything is all right.

00:04:09.256 --> 00:04:10.936
That's my girl.

00:04:11.536 --> 00:04:13.936
Does this mean
we have to move again?

00:04:14.096 --> 00:04:15.576
(ALL LAUGHING)

00:04:17.576 --> 00:04:18.936
LITTLE BOY: Oh, man.

00:04:19.136 --> 00:04:21.936
That was totally wicked!

00:04:26.176 --> 00:04:27.696
3 MONTHS LATER

00:04:27.816 --> 00:04:29.496
(PA ANNOUNCEMENTS)

00:04:35.256 --> 00:04:36.976
(JACK-JACK LAUGHING)

00:04:38.936 --> 00:04:41.376
Do we have to
have cheerleaders
at the track meet?

00:04:41.456 --> 00:04:43.296
What is that
all about?

00:04:43.376 --> 00:04:44.376
I always thought
it was more...

00:04:44.456 --> 00:04:46.016
Hey.
Hey.

00:04:46.096 --> 00:04:47.616
You're, uh, Violet, right?

00:04:47.736 --> 00:04:48.736
That's me.

00:04:48.856 --> 00:04:50.776
See you, Vi.
You look different.

00:04:51.136 --> 00:04:54.456
I feel different.
Is different okay?

00:04:54.616 --> 00:04:57.896
Hey, different is...
(CLEARS THROAT)
Different is great.

00:04:57.976 --> 00:04:59.936
(STAMMERING)
Would you...

00:05:00.136 --> 00:05:01.656
Yeah?
Do you think maybe...

00:05:01.776 --> 00:05:03.376
(STAMMERING)
...you and I...
Yeah?

00:05:03.496 --> 00:05:04.896
Do you...
Shh.

00:05:05.016 --> 00:05:08.256
I like movies.
I'll buy the popcorn.
Okay?

00:05:09.136 --> 00:05:11.336
(STAMMERING) A movie.
There you go. Yeah.

00:05:11.416 --> 00:05:13.416
Wait, so Friday?

00:05:13.496 --> 00:05:14.656
Friday.

00:05:16.336 --> 00:05:17.856
(CROWD CHEERING)

00:05:19.256 --> 00:05:21.576
Go, Dash, go.
Run!

00:05:21.656 --> 00:05:24.656
BOB: Come on, run!
Pick up the pace.

00:05:24.736 --> 00:05:25.736
ALL: Run!

00:05:25.816 --> 00:05:27.256
Pull back, pull back!

00:05:27.336 --> 00:05:29.816
Pace it.
Slow down just
a little bit.

00:05:30.496 --> 00:05:32.016
Make it close!
Second.

00:05:32.096 --> 00:05:34.656
BOB AND HELEN:
Close second, yeah!

00:05:39.456 --> 00:05:41.016
BOB: That's my boy!

00:05:41.336 --> 00:05:43.096
Dash, I'm so
proud of you.

00:05:43.176 --> 00:05:44.776
DASH: I didn't know
what the heck you
wanted me to do.

00:05:44.856 --> 00:05:47.336
(CRASHING, SCREAMING)

00:05:58.096 --> 00:06:01.096
Behold the Underminer!

00:06:01.776 --> 00:06:04.256
I am always beneath you,

00:06:04.336 --> 00:06:07.256
but nothing
is beneath me!

00:06:07.696 --> 00:06:13.336
I hereby declare war
on peace and happiness!

00:06:14.056 --> 00:06:18.616
Soon all will
tremble before me!

